@warehouseFlowHost = http://localhost:5101

### 获取演示 JWT
POST {{warehouseFlowHost}}/api/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "demo", "password": "demo123" }

### 查询库存（无需登录）
GET {{warehouseFlowHost}}/api/inventory

### 收货入库（将上一步 token 替换到这里）
POST {{warehouseFlowHost}}/api/inventory/receive
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "RM-1001", "locationCode": "A-01-01", "quantity": 50, "referenceNo": "ASN-20260830-001" }

### 订单预占
POST {{warehouseFlowHost}}/api/inventory/reserve
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "RM-1001", "quantity": 20, "orderNo": "SO-20260830-001" }
